      "index": 1,
      "type": "question",
      "text": "業務の振り分けにAIの判定APIを使う場合、何を先に決め、どう確かめますか。",
      "audio": "interview-question-01.mp3",
      "audioHash": "ca99e0c223680b4eeb3079ac846c77e197751bf2927916bb2eb50d71ab7d944b",
